{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"g_market","type":"group","x":0,"y":0,"width":2720,"height":940,"label":"一、市场与发行 · Markets and issuance","color":"5"},
		{"id":"g_index","type":"group","x":0,"y":1080,"width":2720,"height":1300,"label":"二、指数与比较口径 · Indices and conventions","color":"6"},
		{"id":"g_order","type":"group","x":0,"y":2520,"width":2720,"height":1620,"label":"三、订单与成交 · Orders and execution","color":"4"},
		{"id":"g_settle","type":"group","x":0,"y":4280,"width":2720,"height":340,"label":"四、清算与交收 · Clearing and settlement","color":"2"},
		{"id":"g_funding","type":"group","x":0,"y":4760,"width":2720,"height":700,"label":"五、融资与卖空 · Financing and short selling","color":"3"},
		{"id":"course","type":"text","x":40,"y":-300,"width":2640,"height":220,"color":"5","text":"# 证券市场、订单与结算\n\n[[02_Economy/06_证券投资学/02_证券市场与交易|沿课程连续阅读]]\n\n先跟着资金走，再辨指数与指令；成交之后还要履行交收及融资义务。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFollow the cash, identify index and order conventions, then check settlement and financing obligations.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m011","type":"text","x":40,"y":80,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[证券市场]]\n\n组织发行与转让的制度和网络。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nInstitutions and networks for issuance and trading.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m015","type":"text","x":1150,"y":80,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[证券交易所]]\n\n以准入、交易与市场管理规则组织成交。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAn exchange organizes execution under its rules.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m016","type":"text","x":2260,"y":80,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[场外市场]]\n\n场外也可有电子设施、规则与监管。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nOTC trading can be electronic and regulated.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m012","type":"text","x":40,"y":380,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[一级市场]]\n\n新发行证券；募集资金流向发行人。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nNew securities raise funds for the issuer.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m013","type":"text","x":1150,"y":380,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[二级市场]]\n\n既有证券转手；买价通常归卖方。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nExisting securities change hands; sellers receive proceeds.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m014","type":"text","x":2260,"y":380,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[二级流动性与发行价格]]\n\n其他风险固定，退出成本可影响认购愿付价。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nWith other risks fixed, exit costs can affect issue pricing.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m018","type":"text","x":40,"y":680,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[发行注册与投资价值]]\n\n发行与披露合规，不是投资回报担保。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nRegistration is not a guarantee of investment merit.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m019","type":"text","x":1150,"y":680,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[证券监管目标]]\n\n保护投资者、维护市场、降低系统性风险。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nProtection, market integrity and lower systemic risk are objectives.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m017","type":"text","x":2260,"y":680,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[证券经纪与自营]]\n\n按这笔交易区分代理客户或自担头寸。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nIdentify agency or principal capacity for the transaction.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m061","type":"text","x":40,"y":1160,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[股票价格指数]]\n\n按明确样本与规则汇总股价变化。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA defined sample and methodology summarize stock-price changes.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m062","type":"text","x":780,"y":1160,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[股价平均数]]\n\n同一时点的平均价格，仍有价格单位。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA cross-sectional average retains price units.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m070","type":"text","x":1520,"y":1160,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[指数除数调整]]\n\n按规定事件保持连续；不抹平真实涨跌。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nPreserve required continuity, not erase real price moves.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m073","type":"text","x":2260,"y":1160,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[指数口径核对]]\n\n核对样本、权重、币种、收入及规则版本。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nCheck membership, weights, currency, income and methodology.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m063","type":"text","x":40,"y":1480,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[价格加权指数]]\n\n高单价股票影响更大；持续维护除数。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nHigher share prices carry more weight; maintain the divisor.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m064","type":"text","x":780,"y":1480,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[市值加权指数]]\n\n看价格乘纳入股数；收益聚合用相应期初权重。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nUse included market value and applicable beginning return weights.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m065","type":"text","x":1520,"y":1480,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[等权指数]]\n\n再平衡时等金额；期间权重可以漂移。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nEqual cash weights at rebalancing can drift afterward.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m071","type":"text","x":2260,"y":1480,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[价格指数与全收益指数]]\n\n计入分配收入；再投资时点按规则。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nInclude distributions; reinvestment timing follows the methodology.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m066","type":"text","x":40,"y":1800,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[价格相对数算术平均]]\n\n先算各股价格比，再按给定权重相加。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAverage individual price relatives arithmetically.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m067","type":"text","x":780,"y":1800,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[价格相对数几何平均]]\n\n对正价格比作加权几何平均。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nTake a weighted geometric mean of positive price relatives.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m074","type":"text","x":1520,"y":1800,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[Fisher价格指数]]\n\n对同基值的拉氏与派氏指数取几何平均。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nTake the geometric mean of same-base Laspeyres and Paasche indices.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m072","type":"text","x":2260,"y":1800,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[债券指数]]\n\n按规则选择与估值，并核对利息与到期处理。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nSpecify eligibility, valuation, interest and maturity treatment.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m068","type":"text","x":780,"y":2120,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[拉氏价格指数]]\n\n上下用同一基期数量篮子。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nCompare prices using the same base-period quantities.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m069","type":"text","x":1520,"y":2120,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[派氏价格指数]]\n\n上下用同一报告期数量篮子。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nCompare prices using the same current-period quantities.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m021","type":"text","x":40,"y":2600,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[报价驱动市场]]\n\n交易围绕交易商提供的买卖报价展开。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nTrading is organized around dealer quotations.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m023","type":"text","x":780,"y":2600,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[做市商]]\n\n以自身账户承接交易，库存与信息风险仍在。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nTrade as principal while bearing inventory and information risk.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m022","type":"text","x":1520,"y":2600,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[订单驱动市场]]\n\n由参与者订单及撮合规则组织成交。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nParticipant orders and matching rules organize execution.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m024","type":"text","x":2260,"y":2600,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[限价订单簿]]\n\n记录未成交限价、数量与优先关系。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nRecord resting limit orders, quantities and priorities.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m028","type":"text","x":40,"y":2920,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[集合竞价]]\n\n汇集订单，在规定时点按规则形成统一价。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nCollected orders meet at a rule-based auction price.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m029","type":"text","x":780,"y":2920,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[连续竞价]]\n\n到达订单与存量订单持续撮合。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nIncoming and resting orders are matched continuously.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m027","type":"text","x":1520,"y":2920,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[价格时间优先]]\n\n先价格，再同价可比订单的时间；非全球通则。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nPrice then time among comparable orders; not universal.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m031","type":"text","x":2260,"y":2920,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[市场深度]]\n\n给定时点与价格范围内可成交的数量。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nExecutable quantity within a stated price range and time.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m036","type":"text","x":40,"y":3240,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[止损单]]\n\n触发后转市价；止损价不保证成交价。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nThe trigger activates a market order, not a guaranteed price.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m025","type":"text","x":780,"y":3240,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[市价单]]\n\n无委托人自定限价；仍有规则与流动性限制。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nNo user-set execution limit; rules and liquidity still constrain fills.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m026","type":"text","x":1520,"y":3240,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[限价单]]\n\n买入最高价、卖出最低价；可能不成交。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA price boundary can leave an order unfilled.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m037","type":"text","x":2260,"y":3240,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[止损限价单]]\n\n触发后仍须守限价；可能持续未成交。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nThe triggered limit order may remain unfilled.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m032","type":"text","x":40,"y":3560,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[市场流动性]]\n\n在给定数量和时限内，以较小成本成交。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nTrade a specified size within a horizon at low cost.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m030","type":"text","x":780,"y":3560,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[买卖价差]]\n\n同口径最佳卖价减最佳买价。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nBest ask minus best bid under a common quotation convention.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m034","type":"text","x":1520,"y":3560,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[逐档成交均价]]\n\n静态假设下逐档配量，再按实际成交量加权。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAllocate static-book fills, then quantity-weight executed prices.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m033","type":"text","x":2260,"y":3560,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[市场冲击]]\n\n自身交易造成价格变化；不包揽全部市场变动。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nPrice effects caused by the trade, not every market move.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m035","type":"text","x":1520,"y":3880,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[证券交易成本]]\n\n显性费用与隐性执行代价；未成交部分也需评估。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nExplicit and implicit costs; assess unfilled quantities too.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m041","type":"text","x":40,"y":4360,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"2","text":"## [[证券清算]]\n\n核对交易并确定待履行义务；不必进行净额处理。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nEstablish obligations; clearing need not involve netting.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m042","type":"text","x":780,"y":4360,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"2","text":"## [[证券结算]]\n\n以证券与所需资金转移履约；确认最终性。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nDischarge obligations through transfers and establish finality.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m043","type":"text","x":1520,"y":4360,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"2","text":"## [[货银对付]]\n\n证券与对应付款的最终完成互为条件。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nLink final securities delivery and final payment conditionally.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m044","type":"text","x":2260,"y":4360,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"2","text":"## [[货银对付的风险边界]]\n\n有效 DvP 防本金风险；重置与资金风险仍在。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nEffective DvP removes principal risk, not replacement or liquidity risk.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m048","type":"text","x":40,"y":4840,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"3","text":"## [[融资买入]]\n\n证券多头加融资债务；跌价不减免贷款。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA long position plus debt; a price fall does not cancel the loan.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m049","type":"text","x":780,"y":4840,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"3","text":"## [[融资买入收益率]]\n\n固定规模模型：资产损益扣借款成本，除初始权益。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nUnder fixed-position assumptions, net gains are scaled by initial equity.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m050","type":"text","x":1520,"y":4840,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"3","text":"## [[证券账户初始保证金]]\n\n开立或增加融资头寸时的最低自有权益。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nMinimum own equity for opening or increasing a financed position.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m051","type":"text","x":2260,"y":4840,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"3","text":"## [[证券账户维持保证金]]\n\n持仓期间检验当前权益；不保证亏损上限。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nMaintain current equity; the requirement is not a loss cap.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m045","type":"text","x":40,"y":5160,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"3","text":"## [[卖空]]\n\n卖出不拥有的证券；借券时须返还同种同量。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nSell unowned securities; return equivalent securities if borrowed.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m046","type":"text","x":780,"y":5160,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"3","text":"## [[卖空损益]]\n\n价差之外，还计借券费、分配补偿等现金流。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nCount borrowing costs and distribution compensation as well as the spread.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m047","type":"text","x":1520,"y":5160,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"3","text":"## [[卖空借券与定位]]\n\n美国 locate 示例：可借来源不等于已借到券。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA US locate identifies a source; it is not completed borrowing.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"m052","type":"text","x":2260,"y":5160,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"3","text":"## [[融资账户追保计算]]\n\n先固定分母与补款操作，再算缺额和阈值。\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFix the denominator and cash operation before computing a shortfall.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"r01","fromNode":"g_market","toNode":"g_index","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"再用指数汇总价格"},
		{"id":"r02","fromNode":"g_index","toNode":"g_order","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"回到具体数量与委托"},
		{"id":"r03","fromNode":"g_order","toNode":"g_settle","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"成交后仍须履行义务"},
		{"id":"r04","fromNode":"g_settle","toNode":"g_funding","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"融资交易另有借款与借券义务"},
